// z2ui5_cci.cc.Validator - checks a form against rules the backend declared,                                                                                                                                                                                  
// without a roundtrip.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
//                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
// The app describes what a field has to satisfy (`quantity` is a number                                                                                                                                                                                       
// greater than 0, `email` looks like an e-mail), binds the rule table to this                                                                                                                                                                                 
// control, and raises `trigger` when it wants the form checked. The control                                                                                                                                                                                   
// puts the value state and the message on every offending field and writes the                                                                                                                                                                                
// outcome back into the model, so the same roundtrip that raised the trigger                                                                                                                                                                                  
// brings ABAP both the verdict and the list of errors.                                                                                                                                                                                                        
//                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
// Ported from abap2UI5-addons/custom-controls (z2ui5_cl_cc_validator). Four                                                                                                                                                                                   
// changes of substance:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
//                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
//   1. the rules are a TABLE keyed by field, not a structure with three fixed                                                                                                                                                                                 
//      slots called email/number/date. The original could only ever validate                                                                                                                                                                                  
//      those three ids.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
//   2. no ajv from a CDN. The original pulled a 120 KB JSON-schema engine to                                                                                                                                                                                  
//      evaluate six constraints; those six are implemented here directly, so                                                                                                                                                                                  
//      the control works on a system with no internet access.                                                                                                                                                                                                 
//   3. the result reaches ABAP. The original logged errors to the browser                                                                                                                                                                                     
//      console - the backend never learned whether the form was valid.                                                                                                                                                                                        
//   4. no `sap.z2ui5.oView...` cascade and no globally installed                                                                                                                                                                                              
//      `sap.z2ui5._validate` function: fields are resolved against the view                                                                                                                                                                                   
//      this control was rendered in, and validation is triggered through a                                                                                                                                                                                    
//      bound property like any other abap2UI5 state change.                                                                                                                                                                                                   
sap.ui.define(                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
  ["sap/ui/core/Control", "sap/ui/core/library", "z2ui5_cci/cc/Util"],                                                                                                                                                                                         
  (Control, coreLibrary, Util) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    "use strict";                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    const ValueState = coreLibrary.ValueState;                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // The properties a value can live in, most specific first - a DatePicker                                                                                                                                                                                  
    // carries a real Date in dateValue and its text in value, and the Date is                                                                                                                                                                                 
    // the one worth checking. value comes before selectedKey: sap.m.Input                                                                                                                                                                                     
    // declares selectedKey too, and it stays "" unless a suggestion was                                                                                                                                                                                       
    // picked - the controls that keep their value elsewhere are named in                                                                                                                                                                                      
    // BY_CLASS.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    const VALUE_PROPERTIES = ["dateValue", "selected", "value", "selectedKey"];                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // Controls whose value is not in `value`, checked in this order - the                                                                                                                                                                                     
    // first class the control is an instance of decides. MultiInput extends                                                                                                                                                                                   
    // Input and has a `value` too, but that is the text typed and not yet                                                                                                                                                                                     
    // turned into a token; MultiComboBox' `value` is likewise only the typed                                                                                                                                                                                  
    // filter text. What was chosen is the tokens / the selected keys.                                                                                                                                                                                         
    const BY_CLASS = [                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
      ["sap.m.MultiComboBox", (control) => control.getSelectedKeys() || []],                                                                                                                                                                                   
      [                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
        "sap.m.MultiInput",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
        (control) =>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
          (control.getTokens() || []).map((token) => token.getKey() || token.getText()),                                                                                                                                                                       
      ],                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
      ["sap.m.Switch", (control) => control.getState()],                                                                                                                                                                                                       
      ["sap.m.Select", (control) => control.getSelectedKey()],                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ["sap.m.ComboBox", (control) => control.getSelectedKey()],                                                                                                                                                                                               
      ["sap.m.SegmentedButton", (control) => control.getSelectedKey()],                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ];                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // Deliberately permissive: enough to catch a typo, not an attempt to                                                                                                                                                                                      
    // decide which addresses exist.                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    const EMAIL = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/;                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // The field's value as the type it has: a string, a Date, a boolean                                                                                                                                                                                       
    // (CheckBox, RadioButton, Switch) or a list (MultiComboBox, MultiInput).                                                                                                                                                                                  
    const readValue = (control) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
      const special = control.isA && BY_CLASS.find(([name]) => control.isA(name));                                                                                                                                                                             
      if (special) return special[1](control);                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      // declared by the control's metadata - "in mProperties" is true for                                                                                                                                                                                     
      // every property, the bag's prototype holds the defaults                                                                                                                                                                                                
      const metadata = control.getMetadata && control.getMetadata();                                                                                                                                                                                           
      for (const property of VALUE_PROPERTIES) {                                                                                                                                                                                                               
        const getter = `get${property.charAt(0).toUpperCase()}${property.slice(1)}`;                                                                                                                                                                           
        if (typeof control[getter] === "function" &&                                                                                                                                                                                                           
            metadata && metadata.getProperty(property)) {                                                                                                                                                                                                      
          return control[getter]();                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
        }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
      }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      return "";                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    };                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // A box that is not ticked and a list with nothing chosen are what                                                                                                                                                                                        
    // `required` is about, so false and [] count as empty.                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    const isEmpty = (value) =>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      value === undefined ||                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
      value === null ||                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      value === "" ||                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
      value === false ||                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
      (Array.isArray(value) && value.length === 0);                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    const toText = (value) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
      if (value instanceof Date) return value.toISOString();                                                                                                                                                                                                   
      if (Array.isArray(value)) return value.join(",");                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      return String(value ?? "");                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    };                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // MINIMUM/MAXIMUM arrive as text (an older backend sends a number): empty                                                                                                                                                                                 
    // is no limit, so a limit of 0 is checked like any other.                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    const toLimit = (value) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      if (isEmpty(value)) return null;                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
      const num = Number(value);                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      return Number.isFinite(num) ? num : null;                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    };                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // Returns the failure message, or "" when the rule holds.                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    function check(rule, value) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
      const text = toText(value);                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      if (rule.REQUIRED && isEmpty(value)) return rule.MESSAGE || "Entry required";                                                                                                                                                                            
      // An empty optional field is not an error - only a filled one is                                                                                                                                                                                        
      // measured against the constraints.                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
      if (isEmpty(value)) return "";                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      const type = String(rule.TYPE || "").toLowerCase();                                                                                                                                                                                                      
      if (type === "number" || type === "integer") {                                                                                                                                                                                                           
        const num = Number(text);                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
        if (!Number.isFinite(num)) return rule.MESSAGE || "Enter a number";                                                                                                                                                                                    
        if (type === "integer" && !Number.isInteger(num)) {                                                                                                                                                                                                    
          return rule.MESSAGE || "Enter a whole number";                                                                                                                                                                                                       
        }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
        const min = toLimit(rule.MINIMUM);                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
        if (min !== null && num < min) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          return rule.MESSAGE || `Enter a value of at least ${min}`;                                                                                                                                                                                           
        }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
        const max = toLimit(rule.MAXIMUM);                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
        if (max !== null && num > max) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          return rule.MESSAGE || `Enter a value of at most ${max}`;                                                                                                                                                                                            
        }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
      }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      if (rule.MINLENGTH && text.length < rule.MINLENGTH) {                                                                                                                                                                                                    
        return rule.MESSAGE || `Enter at least ${rule.MINLENGTH} characters`;                                                                                                                                                                                  
      }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      if (rule.MAXLENGTH && text.length > rule.MAXLENGTH) {                                                                                                                                                                                                    
        return rule.MESSAGE || `Enter at most ${rule.MAXLENGTH} characters`;                                                                                                                                                                                   
      }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      const format = String(rule.FORMAT || "").toLowerCase();                                                                                                                                                                                                  
      if (format === "email" && !EMAIL.test(text)) {                                                                                                                                                                                                           
        return rule.MESSAGE || "Enter a valid e-mail address";                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      if (format === "date" && Number.isNaN(new Date(text).getTime())) {                                                                                                                                                                                       
        return rule.MESSAGE || "Enter a valid date";                                                                                                                                                                                                           
      }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      if (rule.PATTERN) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
        let regex;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
        try {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          regex = new RegExp(rule.PATTERN);                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
        } catch (e) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
          // A broken pattern is the app's bug, not the user's - do not fail                                                                                                                                                                                   
          // the field over it.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
          Util.logError(`Validator: rule for '${rule.FIELD}' has an invalid pattern`, e);                                                                                                                                                                      
          return "";                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
        }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
        if (!regex.test(text)) return rule.MESSAGE || "Entry has the wrong format";                                                                                                                                                                            
      }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      return "";                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    const Validator = Control.extend("z2ui5_cci.cc.Validator", {                                                                                                                                                                                               
      metadata: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
        properties: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
          // [{ FIELD, TYPE, FORMAT, PATTERN, REQUIRED, MINLENGTH, MAXLENGTH,                                                                                                                                                                                  
          //    MINIMUM, MAXIMUM, MESSAGE }] - FIELD is the control id as the                                                                                                                                                                                  
          // app wrote it in the view                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
          rules: { type: "object[]", defaultValue: [] },                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          // raise it to run the check; 0 never validates, so a freshly opened                                                                                                                                                                                 
          // form does not greet the user with red fields, and neither does a                                                                                                                                                                                  
          // rebuilt view whose trigger was raised before (Util.triggerFired)                                                                                                                                                                                  
          trigger: { type: "int", defaultValue: 0 },                                                                                                                                                                                                           
          // written back: verdict and the offending fields                                                                                                                                                                                                    
          valid: { type: "boolean", defaultValue: true },                                                                                                                                                                                                      
          errors: { type: "object[]", defaultValue: [] },                                                                                                                                                                                                      
        },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
        events: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          validated: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
            parameters: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
              valid: { type: "boolean" },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
              count: { type: "int" },                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
            },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
          },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
        },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
      },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      // one rule against one value - see check; on the control for the                                                                                                                                                                                        
      // tests in tools/                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
      _check: check,                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      _clear(control) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
        if (control.setValueState) control.setValueState(ValueState.None);                                                                                                                                                                                     
        if (control.setValueStateText) control.setValueStateText("");                                                                                                                                                                                          
      },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      _reject(control, message) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
        if (control.setValueState) control.setValueState(ValueState.Error);                                                                                                                                                                                    
        if (control.setValueStateText) control.setValueStateText(message);                                                                                                                                                                                     
      },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      validate() {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
        const rules = this.getRules() || [];                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
        const errors = [];                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
        // A field may have several rules (the table has no key). Every field                                                                                                                                                                                  
        // is cleared once up front and keeps the message of its FIRST failing                                                                                                                                                                                 
        // rule: clearing per rule would let a later rule that holds wipe the                                                                                                                                                                                  
        // error of an earlier one - a field that looks fine on a form that                                                                                                                                                                                    
        // reports itself invalid.                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
        const checks = [];                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
        rules.forEach((rule) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          const control = Util.resolveControl(this, rule.FIELD);                                                                                                                                                                                               
          if (!control) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
            Util.logError(                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
              `Validator: no control found for field '${rule.FIELD}'`,                                                                                                                                                                                         
            );                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
            return;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
          }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
          checks.push([rule, control]);                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
        });                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
        new Set(checks.map(([, control]) => control)).forEach((control) =>                                                                                                                                                                                     
          this._clear(control),                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
        );                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
        const rejected = new Set();                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
        checks.forEach(([rule, control]) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          if (rejected.has(control)) return;                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
          const message = check(rule, readValue(control));                                                                                                                                                                                                     
          if (!message) return;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
          rejected.add(control);                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
          this._reject(control, message);                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
          errors.push({ FIELD: rule.FIELD, MESSAGE: message });                                                                                                                                                                                                
        });                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
        // Suppress invalidation - the control renders nothing, and the model                                                                                                                                                                                  
        // write-back that carries the verdict to ABAP happens either way.                                                                                                                                                                                     
        this.setProperty("valid", errors.length === 0, true);                                                                                                                                                                                                  
        this.setProperty("errors", errors, true);                                                                                                                                                                                                              
        this.fireValidated({ valid: errors.length === 0, count: errors.length });                                                                                                                                                                              
        return errors.length === 0;                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
      },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      setTrigger(value) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
        const previous = this.getTrigger();                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
        this.setProperty("trigger", value, true);                                                                                                                                                                                                              
        // Only a real change validates: the property is written on every                                                                                                                                                                                      
        // model update, and re-validating on an unrelated one would flag a                                                                                                                                                                                    
        // field the user has not finished typing into yet. The first value of                                                                                                                                                                                 
        // a fresh instance counts only when it is new to this binding                                                                                                                                                                                         
        // (Util.triggerFired) - a view_display must not repaint the errors of                                                                                                                                                                                 
        // the last check onto a form the user is about to fill in again.                                                                                                                                                                                      
        if (Util.triggerFired(this, value, previous)) this.validate();                                                                                                                                                                                         
        return this;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
      },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      renderer: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
        apiVersion: 2,                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
        render(rm, control) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          rm.openStart("span", control);                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          rm.style("display", "none");                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
          rm.openEnd();                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
          rm.close("span");                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
        },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
      },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    });                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    // the pure part, for tools/validator.test.mjs                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    Validator.readValue = readValue;                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    Validator.check = check;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    return Validator;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  },                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
);                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             